AGENTS.md

# Never copy local environment or credentials into build layers
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.aws
**/.ssh
secrets

# Logs, runtime files, and generated test reports
**/*.log
**/logs
**/*.pid
**/*.pid.lock
**/report.*.json
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# Local database files and backups
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.sqlite3-shm
backups
pgdata

# Temporary files and OS metadata
**/.tmp
**/tmp
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.bak
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/*.suo
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
**/$RECYCLE.BIN

# Keep package manifests/lockfiles, configs, src, public, prisma, and scripts.
# Compose's setup service uses the build stage for migrations and admin creation.
